    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»zidCode« 模块",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»zidCode«模块凭借其直观的操作界面，在 ZOLLER 的TMS Tool Management Solutions 刀具管理解决方案软件以及图像处理软件 »pilot 4.0« 中，可助力实现高效优质订单准备。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/4/csm_software_modulzidcode_2043300238.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c952",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»quickPick« 存储模块",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»quickPick« 存储模块提供了一个简易的存储管理界面，可用于处理单个组件、完整刀具、设备、订单及附件等各类物料。仅需数次点击，即可完成仓库库存的预订与记录。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/6/csm_software_quickpick_009cb1287c.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c953",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "NC程序管理 – »zidCode 4.0«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>借助ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions刀具管理解决方案的数控程序管理功能以及»zidCode 4.0«的数据传输功能，机床运行所需的一切条件均已具备，确保操作安全可靠。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/4/csm_software_nc-programmverwaltung_ef69649c40.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 542
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c954",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»idChip« — »zidCode 4.0«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>扫描刀具集成芯片上的DataMatrix码后，数控机床将通过网络获取所有必要的刀具数据。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_software_idchip_9694061981.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c955",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
